{"answer":"Two SupportForce (ortAIX) features were reverted/blocked due to security risks:

1. **AWS Auto Scaling Group (PR #4)** – Merged on 2026-06-05, but later reverted (PR #5) after it was found that the IAM roles/permissions configured were too permissive, risking unauthorized access. It was reverted and had to be reworked with tightened permissions.

2. **CloudWatch Monitoring (PR #17)** – Merged on 2026-07-23, but reverted (PR #18) after it was discovered that the logging setup was capturing sensitive identifiers/data, posing a data-protection/compliance risk. The feature was reverted pending fixes to the logging logic before re-implementation."}

